// Generated by AI (UnitTest MCP)
//! Real PostgreSQL-gated coverage for the Bridge's ADR-0125 Work command
//! routes. ADR-0142 recognizes the Bridge's hardened loopback developer
//! profile (`state.tenant_id`) as a real verified principal for a
//! self-hosted, single-tenant deployment, so a well-formed, correctly
//! attributed request now records a genuine `pending_confirmation` preview
//! against a real `WorkCommandService` -- not the permanent
//! `authorization_unavailable` refusal ADR-0125 shipped before this ADR.

use std::sync::Arc;

